  "description": "Apres Dirt Routt CRD\n\nThe Routt CRD is the ultimate titanium expression of gravel speed. Built with our Race Super Light titanium tube set, fully integrated cable routing, 3D-printed dropouts and brake mounts, T47 bottom bracket, UDH compatibility, and clearance for up to 45c tires, it delivers unmistakable Moots ride quality in its fastest, cleanest form.\nFor the first item from the Moots Secret Menu, the Routt CRD gets a full painted finish inspired by the way dust, grit, and road spray collect on a bike after a good day out. The speckle pattern and front-to-back fade give Après Dirt its just-back-from-the-ride feel, with two colorways pulled from Moots history: Citrus Squeeze and Midnight Sky.\nBIKE IS SOLD AS IS\n\nNO PARTS TO BE SWITCHED\n\nQuestions? Email info@moots.com",
